cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data exports, please cite it as below, and cite the original data providers listed with every value."
title: "Global Debt & Fiscal Atlas"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, browser-based atlas of sovereign debt, deficits, government
  spending, revenue, macroeconomic and development indicators for every
  country, with bilateral debtor-to-creditor relationships from World Bank
  International Debt Statistics. Data are retrieved live from the World Bank
  and IMF APIs with explicit provenance, freshness and a resilient fallback.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Al-Husein"
    given-names: "Jaudat Faisal"
version: 3.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jaudat150/global-debt-explorer"
keywords:
  - sovereign debt
  - public finance
  - government spending
  - fiscal policy
  - open data
  - World Bank
  - IMF
  - Streamlit
  - data visualization
